<h2>Your profit after tax</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>P&amp;L net of tax.</strong> Set your capital-gains tax rate in Settings → Trading → "Tax on gains" and every profit figure — menu bar, portfolios, positions — is shown net. Losses stay as they are; 0 keeps the gross figures.</li>
    <li><strong>Translated settings.</strong> The explanations under the menu-bar settings now follow the app language.</li>
</ul>
